mya — license and attribution
==============================

This repository is a community project that combines code from multiple
sources with different licensing situations. Please read this file before
using, forking, or redistributing any part of it.


1. Ancestry
-----------

The coding-agent body of this repository (the top-level `src/`, `scripts/`,
`bin/mya`, `assets/`, etc.) is derived from:

    https://github.com/paoloanzn/free-code

which is itself a derivative of an earlier upstream project:

    https://github.com/ultraworkers/claw-code

The `paoloanzn/free-code` repository does **not** ship a LICENSE file, and
neither does its parent. No explicit redistribution grant exists in the
upstream chain, and this repository cannot grant you one. The original
copyright in the agent body remains with its original authors.


