3. Disclaimer
-------------

  - This is a community project. It is **not affiliated with, endorsed by,
    or sanctioned by** any of the original upstream authors or rights
    holders.
  - The agent body inherits modifications from `paoloanzn/free-code`,
    including telemetry removal and the stripping of system-prompt safety
    guardrails. Users are fully responsible for the behavior of any agent
    they run with this code.
  - The entire repository is provided **"AS IS"**, without warranty of
    any kind. You assume all legal and operational risk of running,
    distributing, or building upon this code.


4. Takedown
-----------

If you are a rights holder over any code included in this repository and
you believe it infringes on your rights, please file a DMCA notice through
GitHub (https://github.com/contact/dmca) or open an issue on this
repository. The maintainer will cooperate promptly.
